# =============================================================================
# 受控源 (Controlled Sources)
# =============================================================================
# 验证四种线性受控源：VCVS(E)、VCCS(G)、CCCS(F)、CCVS(H)。
# 四个独立小电路，各自用独立节点，互不影响。
#
# 元件格式（均为 4 引脚 cp,cn,op,on）:
#   E (VCVS):  Vout = gain × V(cp,cn)
#   G (VCCS):  Iout = gm   × V(cp,cn)
#   F (CCCS):  Iout = gain × I(cp→地)   (内部0V测量源 vmeas 在 cp-地 之间)
#   H (CCVS):  Vout = rm   × I(cp→地)
#
# 预期结果:
#   E: node 2 = 2 × 2V = 4V
#   G: node 4 = 1mA × 1kΩ = 1V          (1mS × 1V = 1mA)
#   F: node 8 = 2 × 5mA × 1kΩ = 10V     (控制电流=5V/1kΩ=5mA, 增益2)
#   H: node 12 = 1kΩ × 5mA = 5V         (控制电流=5mA, 跨阻1kΩ)
#
# 注意: CCCS/CCVS 的 cn 必须接 -1(地)，内部 vmeas 测量 cp→地 的支路电流。
#
# 运行命令:
#   circuit -t 0.001 cmd/circuits/13_controlled_sources.net
# =============================================================================

# --- VCVS (E): Vout = 2 × Vin ---
V1 [1,-1] [0,0,0,0,2]   # 控制电压 2V
E1 [1,-1,2,-1] [2]      # VCVS 增益2: 输出 = 2×2V = 4V
R1 [2,-1] [1000]        # 负载 1kΩ

# --- VCCS (G): Iout = gm × Vin ---
V2 [3,-1] [0,0,0,0,1]   # 控制电压 1V
G1 [3,-1,4,-1] [0.001]  # VCCS gm=1mS: 输出电流 = 1mS×1V = 1mA
R2 [4,-1] [1000]        # 负载 1kΩ → 1V

# --- CCCS (F): Iout = gain × I_control ---
V3 [5,-1] [0,0,0,0,5]   # 5V 电压源
R3 [5,6] [1000]         # 1kΩ，节点5-6 → 控制电流 = 5V/1kΩ = 5mA
F1 [6,-1,8,-1] [2]      # CCCS 增益2: cp=6, cn=-1(地)
R5 [8,-1] [1000]        # 输出负载 1kΩ → 2×5mA×1kΩ = 10V

# --- CCVS (H): Vout = rm × I_control ---
V4 [9,-1] [0,0,0,0,5]   # 5V 电压源
R6 [9,10] [1000]        # 1kΩ，节点9-10 → 控制电流 5mA
H1 [10,-1,12,-1] [1000] # CCVS 跨阻1kΩ: cp=10, cn=-1(地)
R8 [12,-1] [1000]       # 输出负载 1kΩ → 1000×5mA = 5V
